{"v":1,"book":"Lev","ch":7,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"And this is the law of the trespass offering; it is most holy;","tok":[{"t":"And this is the "},{"t":"law","s":["H8451"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of the trespass "},{"t":"offering","s":["H0817"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; it is "},{"t":"most","s":["H6944"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"holy","s":["H6944"],"a":[4]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":2,"text":"In the place where they slaughter the burnt offering they shall slaughter the trespass offering, and its blood he shall sprinkle on and around the altar.","tok":[{"t":"In the "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[0]},{"t":" where they slaughter the burnt "},{"t":"offering","s":["H5930"],"a":[4]},{"t":" they shall slaughter the trespass "},{"t":"offering","s":["H0817"],"a":[7]},{"t":", and its "},{"t":"blood","s":["H1818"],"a":[9]},{"t":" he shall "},{"t":"sprinkle","s":["H2236"],"a":[10]},{"t":" on and "},{"t":"around","s":["H5439"],"a":[13]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"altar","s":["H4196"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And he shall present from it all its fat: the fat tail, and the fat that covers the inward parts,","tok":[{"t":"And he shall present from it all its "},{"t":"fat","s":["H2459"],"a":[2]},{"t":": the fat tail, and the "},{"t":"fat","s":["H2459"],"a":[8]},{"t":" that "},{"t":"covers","s":["H3680"],"a":[9]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"inward","s":["H7130"],"a":[11]},{"t":" parts,"}]},{"n":4,"text":"And the two kidneys and the fat that is on them, which is on the loins, and the appendage upon the liver, which he shall remove with the kidneys.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"two","s":["H8147"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"kidneys","s":["H3629"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"fat","s":["H2459"],"a":[4]},{"t":" that is on them, which is on the loins, and the appendage upon the "},{"t":"liver","s":["H3516"],"a":[13]},{"t":", which he shall remove with the "},{"t":"kidneys","s":["H3629"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"And the priest shall burn them on the altar as an offering by fire to Jehovah; it is a trespass offering.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"priest","s":["H3548"],"a":[2]},{"t":" shall "},{"t":"burn","s":["H6999"],"a":[0]},{"t":" them on the "},{"t":"altar","s":["H4196"],"a":[3]},{"t":" as an offering by "},{"t":"fire","s":["H0801"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; it is a trespass "},{"t":"offering","s":["H0817"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Every male among the priests may eat of it; it shall be eaten in a holy place; it is most holy.","tok":[{"t":"Every "},{"t":"male","s":["H2145"],"a":[1]},{"t":" among the "},{"t":"priests","s":["H3548"],"a":[2]},{"t":" may "},{"t":"eat","s":["H0398"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of it; it shall be "},{"t":"eaten","s":["H0398"],"a":[6]},{"t":" in a "},{"t":"holy","s":["H6918"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; it is "},{"t":"most","s":["H6944"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"holy","s":["H6944"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"The trespass offering is like the sin offering; there is one law for them: The priest who makes expiation with it shall have it.","tok":[{"t":"The trespass "},{"t":"offering","s":["H2403"],"a":[0]},{"t":" is like the sin "},{"t":"offering","s":["H0817"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; there is "},{"t":"one","s":["H0259"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"law","s":["H8451"],"a":[2]},{"t":" for them: The "},{"t":"priest","s":["H3548"],"a":[5]},{"t":" who makes expiation with it shall have it."}]},{"n":8,"text":"And the priest who presents anyone’s burnt offering, that priest shall have for himself the skin of the burnt offering which he has presented.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"priest","s":["H3548"],"a":[0]},{"t":" who presents anyone’s burnt "},{"t":"offering","s":["H5930"],"a":[3]},{"t":", that "},{"t":"priest","s":["H3548"],"a":[9]},{"t":" shall have for himself the "},{"t":"skin","s":["H5785"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the burnt "},{"t":"offering","s":["H5930"],"a":[6]},{"t":" which he has presented."}]},{"n":9,"text":"And every meal offering that is baked in an oven